      "message": "What is this \"closedNodes\" tombstone\" mentioned in commit-message? The activeGenerations map? Please clarify/rewrite so it matches the actual implementation. Also that entire sentence is quite weird, so please revisit the entire commit-message.",
      "revId": "b471a67ec693a5734b2e0f53f0d35da95ffa1323",
